+
+**The open set.** `open_finding_ids` of `scripts/rotate_live_review.py` read 30 open findings at the
+claim base `b8fa02ba` and 7 at round 9's handback `ef2edb49`. Every slice from T001 to T019 has its
+round; the ids the slices did not resolve are named under Carried.
+
+**What changed, by the DECISIONs that ruled it.** The paydown took the whole open set, one slice per
+module, and the integrity check fails a complete context on anything but a pass (D1); `integrity
+block` counts the open set after the round from the block's own ledger payloads (D2); R-1005's two
